<title>CHINA: PAUL Y-ITC YEAR NET PROFIT UP 16.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>PAUL Y-ITC YEAR NET PROFIT UP 16.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   29.1     vs 26.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.8	vs 7.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    303.63   vs 261.13</p>
<p>    Turnover		     7,457.20 vs 5,305.28</p>
<p>    Company name		 Paul Y. - ITC Construction Holdings</p>
<p>				     Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Paul Y-ITC is a civil engineering and construction company.</p>
<p>Total dividend of year is 10.8 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of four cents) vs 11.8 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
